ERP server loop predates the effectful-let rule: erp-server / erp-loop / erp-handle-request bind net-io-send-raw with a plain let (CDX2033). The opening collision (fixed by extracting ErpServerMain) and the Protocol vs MessageFraming frame-encode collision (fixed by frame-encode-record) are resolved; the loop still needs act-form modernization. Un-skip when the ERP server loop uses act-bind for its effectful sends.
